WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.950
Paying for heat protection is about timing.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.780
Money is needed before, to prepare. During, so people can stop. And after, to recover.

3
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:16.050
A payout tied to temperature can miss the real loss: basis risk.

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.550
Protection only counts if it reaches people in time.
